      "article_text": "Finding Aynien Level 30\n    · Adventuring\n    · Mekalia Objectives Unicorn Teleporter\nUse the unicorn teleporter to obtain the name and location of the last missing unicorn. Journey to find the unicorn, and speak with it once you arrive. Notes Use the teleporter. It will identify the last unicorn Aynien in north thestra (Sea of Mist (-29, 29) 2 chunks north of Plains of Anguish). Details Starts with Ardalan Awji Location 50070, 84493, 44118 in Mekalia (-11, -9) Series Unicorn Previous Question And Answer Next Seadredge Doldrums Source https://vanguard.fandom.com/wiki/Finding_Aynien ← Back to quests Guides covering this Part 6 - Down the Last Stretch — VG Walkthroughs Unicorn Mount — World",
      "article_html": "<main class=\"wrap\">\n<div class=\"detail-head\">\n<h1>Finding Aynien</h1>\n<p class=\"muted\">\n    Level 30\n    · Adventuring\n    · <a href=\"/zones/mekalia\">Mekalia</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cols\">\n<div>\n<h2>Objectives</h2>\n<div class=\"tooltip\">Unicorn Teleporter\nUse the unicorn teleporter to obtain the name and location of the last missing unicorn. Journey to find the unicorn, and speak with it once you arrive.</div>\n<h2>Notes</h2>\n<p class=\"muted\">Use the teleporter. It will identify the last unicorn Aynien in north thestra (Sea of Mist (-29, 29) 2 chunks north of Plains of Anguish).</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h2>Details</h2>\n<dl class=\"kv\">\n<div><dt>Starts with</dt><dd><a href=\"/mobs/ardalan-awji\">Ardalan Awji</a>\n</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Location</dt><dd>50070, 84493, 44118 in Mekalia (-11, -9)</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Series</dt><dd>Unicorn</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Previous</dt><dd><a href=\"/quests/question-and-answer\">Question And Answer</a>\n</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Next</dt><dd><a href=\"/quests/seadredge-doldrums\">Seadredge Doldrums</a>\n</dd></div>\n</dl>\n<h2>Source</h2>\n<p class=\"muted\" style=\"word-break:break-all\">https://vanguard.fandom.com/wiki/Finding_Aynien</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin-top:26px\"><a href=\"/quests\">← Back to quests</a></p>\n<h2>Guides covering this</h2>\n<ul class=\"plain\">\n<li>\n<a href=\"/walkthroughs/part-6-down-the-last-stretch\">Part 6 - Down the Last Stretch</a>\n<span class=\"muted\">— VG Walkthroughs</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"/world/unicorn-mount\">Unicorn Mount</a>\n<span class=\"muted\">— World</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</main>",
